Description: Provides a point-and-click Shiny interface to the squidSim
    package for building structured simulations. Users define hierarchical
    data structures, specify predictors and variance components across
    levels, and generate simulated datasets without writing simulation code
    by hand. The app returns both the simulated data and the equivalent
    squidSim call.
